{"sha": "b78a2860c80bad954cb2b294a60b468ea18365d8901152782cfae2a8fdeffc4a", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b1:newton-dynamics} 章 --- 牛顿运动定律}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:newton-dynamics:1}", "读数 $N = m(g + a)$，其中 $a$ 为向上的加速度：向上时，", "$70 \\times 11.81 = \\qty{827}{N}$（``\\qty{84}{kg}''）；向下时，$70 \\times 7.81 =", "\\qty{547}{N}$（``\\qty{56}{kg}''）；匀速时，\\qty{687}{N}", "（\\qty{70}{kg}）；自由落体时，$0$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:newton-dynamics:2}", "两者加速度同为 $a$（绳不可伸长）：$m_1a = T$，", "$m_2a = m_2g - T$，故 $a = m_2g/(m_1 + m_2) = \\qty{3.3}{m/s^2}$，", "$T = m_1a = \\qty{6.5}{N}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:newton-dynamics:3}", "$a = g(\\sin\\alpha - \\mu_d\\cos\\alpha) = 9.81(0.50 - 0.17) = \\qty{3.2}{m/s^2}$；", "$v = \\sqrt{2 \\times 3.2 \\times 5.0} = \\qty{5.7}{m/s}$。与质量无关。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:newton-dynamics:4}", "$k\\Delta\\ell = mg$：$\\Delta\\ell = 0.50 \\times 9.81/200 = \\qty{2.5}{cm}$。", "设 $x$ 为相对平衡位置的位移，$m\\ddot x = -kx$（重力与静态伸长", "相互抵消）：$\\omega_0 = \\sqrt{k/m} = \\qty{20}{rad/s}$，", "$T = \\qty{0.31}{s}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:newton-dynamics:5}", "$\\mu_s = \\tan 22^\\circ = 0.40$。弯道：$v \\leq \\sqrt{\\mu_sgR}$：$\\sqrt{0.8", "\\times 9.81 \\times 50} = \\qty{20}{m/s}$（\\qty{71}{km/h}）；湿滑时，", "\\qty{14}{m/s}（\\qty{50}{km/h}）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:newton-dynamics:6}", "跳伞者：$v_\\infty = \\sqrt{2 \\times 785/(1.2 \\times 0.70)} = \\qty{43}{m/s}$；", "$\\mathrm{Re} = \\rho vL/\\eta \\approx 1.2 \\times 43 \\times 0.5/1.8\\times10^{-5}", "\\approx 10^6$：二次阻力。液滴：$m = \\tfrac43\\pi r^3\\rho_w = \\qty{4.2e-12}{kg}$，", "$v_\\infty = mg/6\\pi\\eta r = 4.1\\times10^{-11}/3.4\\times10^{-9} = \\qty{1.2}{cm/s}$；", "$\\mathrm{Re} = 1.2 \\times 0.012 \\times 2\\times10^{-5}/1.8\\times10^{-5} = 0.02$：", "线性阻力。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:newton-dynamics:7}", "最低点：$v^2 = 2g\\ell(1 - \\cos 60^\\circ) = g\\ell$；$T = mg + mv^2/\\ell =", "2mg$。释放点：$v = 0$，$T = mg\\cos\\theta_0 = 0.5mg$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:newton-dynamics:8}", "$v = \\sqrt{gR\\tan\\beta} = \\sqrt{9.81 \\times 200 \\times 0.268} = \\qty{23}{m/s}$", "（\\qty{82}{km/h}）。速度偏慢时，车有沿斜面下滑的趋势，摩擦力须沿斜面向上；", "速度偏快时，摩擦力沿斜面向下，以提供", "额外的向心力。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:newton-dynamics:9}", "$T\\cos\\alpha = mg$，$T\\sin\\alpha = m\\omega^2\\ell\\sin\\alpha$：$\\omega =", "\\sqrt{g/\\ell\\cos\\alpha} = \\sqrt{9.81/0.866} = \\qty{3.4}{rad/s}$，周期", "\\qty{1.9}{s}；$T = mg/\\cos\\alpha = 1.15mg$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:newton-dynamics:10}", "$a = 27.8/8.0 = \\qty{3.5}{m/s^2}$，$F = \\qty{3.5}{kN}$；$F \\leq \\mu_smg$", "给出 $\\mu_s \\geq a/g = 0.35$。湿路面上，$\\mu_s \\approx 0.4$ 将", "加速度限制在约 $0.4g$，无论发动机功率多大：限制因素是抓地力，而非功率。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:newton-dynamics:11}", "$v = v_\\infty(1 - \\eu^{-t/\\tau})$，$v_\\infty = g\\tau = \\qty{4.9}{m/s}$；", "$z = \\int v = v_\\infty[t - \\tau(1 - \\eu^{-t/\\tau})]$。在 \\qty{2.0}{s} 时：", "$4.9 \\times (2.0 - 0.5 \\times 0.98) = \\qty{7.4}{m}$，真空中则为 $\\tfrac12 gt^2", "= \\qty{20}{m}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:newton-dynamics:12}", "沿径向投影（指向圆心）：$N - mg\\cos\\theta = mv^2/R$，故", "$N = m(v^2/R + g\\cos\\theta)$。最高点（$\\theta = \\pi$）：$N = m(v^2/R - g)", "\\geq 0$ 当且仅当 $v \\geq \\sqrt{gR}$。由速率定律，$v_{\\text{top}}^2 =", "v_0^2 - 4gR \\geq gR$：$v_0 \\geq \\sqrt{5gR}$；此时在最低点，$N =", "m(5g + g) = 6mg$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b1:newton-dynamics:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $m\\dot v = mg$：$v = gt$，$z = \\tfrac12 gt^2$；在 \\qty{10}{s} 时：", "\\qty{98}{m/s}，\\qty{490}{m}。", "", "\\textbf{2.} $mg = \\qty{785}{N}$。", "", "\\textbf{3.} 站在地面上时，地面以 $N = mg$ 向上支撑 --- 这一", "支撑力正是人所感受到的重量。自由落体时没有接触力：", "重力同时作用于每一部分，任何部分都不受挤压。", "", "\\textbf{4.} 在一分钟内精确到百分之几以内，可以；忽略的因素有：", "地球自转（离心项与科里奥利项，", "见\\cref{ch:b1:non-inertial-frames}）和风。", "", "\\textbf{5.} $F_d = \\tfrac12\\rho C_xSv^2 = 0.48\\,v^2$（SI 单位）。", "", "\\textbf{6.} $m\\,\\dd v/\\dd t = mg - 0.48v^2$。", "", "\\textbf{7.} $v_\\infty = \\sqrt{mg/0.48} = \\sqrt{1635} = \\qty{40}{m/s} =", "\\qty{146}{km/h}$。", "", "\\textbf{8.} 除以 $mg$：$\\dd u/\\dd t\\,(v_\\infty/g) = 1 - u^2$；", "$\\tau = 40.4/9.81 = \\qty{4.1}{s}$。", "", "\\textbf{9.} $\\int_0^u\\dd u'/(1 - u'^2) = \\operatorname{artanh}u = t/\\tau$，", "故 $u = \\tanh(t/\\tau)$。", "", "\\textbf{10.} $t = \\tau\\operatorname{artanh}(0.9) = 1.47\\tau = \\qty{6.1}{s}$；", "对 $0.99$：$2.65\\tau = \\qty{11}{s}$。", ""]}